OL,3,GNEWSARare cows part of estate's
OL,4,Arewilding project
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rare breed of cattle has been
OL,7,Fintroduced to the grounds of a historic
OL,8,Fhouse in North Yorkshire as part of a
OL,9,F30-year conservation project.
OL,11,FThe arrival of the White Park cows,
OL,12,Fthought to be one of the most ancient
OL,13,Fspecies of its kind, is the latest
OL,14,Fphase of the Bog Hall rewilding scheme
OL,15,Fon the Castle Howard Estate, near
OL,16,FMalton.
OL,18,FTheir grazing in the newly-sown meadows
OL,19,Fwould "help create a more varied
OL,20,Fhabitat structure", the estate said.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
