OL,3,GNEWSARare cows part of estate's
OL,4,Arewilding project
OL,5,
OL,6,FHead of natural environment, Guy
OL,7,FThallon, said reintroducing animals had
OL,8,Fbeen "inspiring for the whole Castle
OL,9,FHoward team and beyond", with further
OL,10,Fplans to release beavers in the autumn.
